<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cautor</span></b> , ōris, m.
		caveo. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One who is on his guard</i> or <i>is
				wary</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 2, 2,
			6</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>One who is surety</i> or <i>bail for
				any one</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Sest. 7, 15</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
